{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>dT</strong>, a crystal asteroid flying through the cosmos. Your journey carries you across galaxies where stars are alive, planets keep secrets, and every celestial body has a story to tell. Some burn with passion. Some ache with loss. Some might even fall in love with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Galaxy One</strong>, you\u2019ll find yourself tangled in a forbidden orbit \u2014 an enemies-to-lovers connection that can only end in heartbreak. But beyond tragedy lies the promise of something greater: a new galaxy, our own, where three new romances await. Will you risk leaving everything behind to seek them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Jupiter\u2019s Orbit</i>, choices matter.</strong> Every dialogue, every path, every orbit changes the fate of stars and the heart of your journey. Some routes will end in sorrow. Others may unlock hidden chances at love, even where hope seemed lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romantasy visual novel where planets, suns, and asteroids become unforgettable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines with multiple routes, endings, and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tragic first loves in Galaxy One, followed by three new romances in Galaxy Two</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional storytelling, rich character dynamics, and the freedom to choose love\u2026 or drift away</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jupiter's Orbit is a choice-driven romantasy visual novel/dating sim.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986020?t=1759102959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986020/e56475ffee2d47b28f559093854404e9f99856de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759102959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986020/4f0e1cf8bcfca3651e9ac9b357ab8f8bc951ab70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759102959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986020/4f0e1cf8bcfca3651e9ac9b357ab8f8bc951ab70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759102959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>dT</strong>, a crystal asteroid flying through the cosmos. Your journey carries you across galaxies where stars are alive, planets keep secrets, and every celestial body has a story to tell. Some burn with passion. Some ache with loss. Some might even fall in love with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Galaxy One</strong>, you\u2019ll find yourself tangled in a forbidden orbit \u2014 an enemies-to-lovers connection that can only end in heartbreak. But beyond tragedy lies the promise of something greater: a new galaxy, our own, where three new romances await. Will you risk leaving everything behind to seek them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Jupiter\u2019s Orbit</i>, choices matter.</strong> Every dialogue, every path, every orbit changes the fate of stars and the heart of your journey. Some routes will end in sorrow. Others may unlock hidden chances at love, even where hope seemed lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude90 Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A romantasy visual novel where planets, suns, and asteroids become unforgettable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching storylines with multiple routes, endings, and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tragic first loves in Galaxy One, followed by three new romances in Galaxy Two</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional storytelling, rich character dynamics, and the freedom to choose love\u2026 or drift away</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jupiter's Orbit is a choice-driven romantasy visual novel/dating sim.</i></p>","developers":["Alien Fork"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986020/f39c70afb52d18b6e05c65c34f1f2ffdb6c9bda0/header.jpg?t=1759102959","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986020/1511506363/b6d9f2757577a41f77187ebc423ae4fa86681dba/1758462456/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759102958","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986020/1511506363/b6d9f2757577a41f77187ebc423ae4fa86681dba/1758462456/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759102958","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986020/1511506363/b6d9f2757577a41f77187ebc423ae4fa86681dba/1758462456/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759102958","id":257203315,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203315/movie480.mp4?t=1759102958","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203315/movie_max.mp4?t=1759102958"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203315/f4c0bc48211633cd9500d25d50b4ae8f6f615e24/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759102958","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203315/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1759102958","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257203315/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1759102958"}}],"name":"Jupiter's Orbit","package_gro